{"seq":1,"slug":"rewind-memory","title":"内存与压缩：把 40MB 装进整关倒流","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-time-rewind-mechanics/practice/rewind-memory","wordCount":1637,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"内存与压缩-把-40mb-装进整关倒流\">内存与压缩：把 40MB 装进整关倒流</h1><p>《Braid》给自己定了一个近乎苛刻的指标：玩家要能倒回 30 到 60 分钟的完整游玩，而这段历史必须塞进主机上约 40MB 的内存。朴素地每帧存全状态，几分钟就爆了。Jonathan Blow 在 GDC 2010 讲的解法不是某个魔法算法，而是一整套「少存、存小、稀疏存」的组合拳。内存几乎是每个倒流系统的头号成本，也是「短时 demo」和「能上线的长倒流」之间的分水岭。这一篇把 <a href=\"../recording/ring-buffer\">环形缓冲</a> 那条 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>T</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M = f \\cdot T \\cdot S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 的账单里的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 往死里压。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>内存压缩的目标是把单帧字节 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 压到极致，让长时倒流塞进固定内存。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>内存账单</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>T</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M = f \\cdot T \\cdot S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span>；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 由玩法锁死、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span> 已压过，主战场是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li><strong>四刀叠加</strong>：脏标记去静止对象 → delta 去时间冗余 → 量化去精度冗余 → 位打包榨位宽；超长倒流再加多分辨率。</li>\n<li><strong>关键帧</strong>：delta 随机访问需周期性插入全量关键帧作解码起点，与视频 I/P 帧同构。</li>\n<li><strong>时空权衡</strong>：压缩把内存问题转成 CPU 问题，记录侧编码要极快、回放侧可稍慢。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>《Braid》把 30–60 分钟历史塞进约 40MB，靠的正是这四刀依次叠加。</p>\n<h2 id=\"内存预算-先算清账单\">内存预算：先算清账单</h2><p>压缩之前先量化目标。倒流内存由三个量相乘决定，任何优化都作用在其中之一。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>T</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M = f \\cdot T \\cdot S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span> 是采样率、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 是可倒流时长、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 是单帧压缩后字节数。设计需求锁死 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span>（能倒多久是玩法承诺），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span> 已在 <a href=\"../recording/sampling-rate\">采样率与插值</a> 里压过一轮，所以内存战役的主战场是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span>。以《Braid》为例反推：目标 40MB、时长约 3600 秒、若采样 10/s，则单帧预算约</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>M</mi><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>40</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>1024</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>3600</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>≈</mo><mn>1165</mn><mtext> 字节/帧</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S = \\frac{M}{f \\cdot T} = \\frac{40 \\times 1024^2}{10 \\times 3600} \\approx 1165 \\text{ 字节/帧}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2408em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2604em;vertical-align:-0.7693em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4911em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3600</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">40</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">102</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7693em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1165</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">字节</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">帧</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>而这一千多字节里要装下当帧所有活跃对象的状态——不压缩到十分之一根本不可能。下面四种手段依次叠加，正是把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 打下来的方法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"四种压缩手段\">四种压缩手段</h2><p>倒流数据的压缩有其独特性：数据是时间序列、相邻帧高度相似、且只在本次运行内使用（不需跨版本可读），这给了几种针对性极强的手段。</p>\n<p>**增量/差分编码（delta）**是收益最大的一刀。相邻两帧里绝大多数字段没变或只变一点，与其存绝对值，不如存「相对上一帧的差」。配合 <a href=\"../recording/state-snapshots\">状态快照</a> 的脏标记，静止物体的 delta 是零、根本不占空间。差分让 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 从「全状态」降到「每帧变化量」，在多数场景是数量级的节省。代价是随机访问变难——要还原第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 帧得从最近的全量关键帧累加过来，因此要周期性插入关键帧（keyframe）作为解码起点，这与视频的 I/P 帧完全同构。</p>\n<p>**量化（quantization）**是第二刀。游戏状态很少需要 32 位浮点的精度：坐标在已知世界范围内可以映射成 16 位定点，旋转四元数用「最小三分量」法压到 32 位甚至更少，速度、血量按实际范围截断位宽。量化是有损的，但只要误差落在插值和玩家感知的容忍带内就无害。</p>\n<p>**位打包（bit-packing）**是第三刀：不按字节对齐存字段，而是按实际需要的位数紧密排列。一个只有 8 种取值的状态枚举占 3 位而非一整字节，布尔标志合并成位域。配合前面的量化，把「每字段最小位数」榨干。</p>\n<p>**多分辨率（LOD）**是第四刀，也呼应 <a href=\"../recording/ring-buffer\">环形缓冲</a> 的多速率环：越久远的历史精度越低——近 10 秒全精度、10–60 秒降采样、更久远只留稀疏关键帧。玩家对遥远过去的精度不敏感，用精度换容量。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[原始每帧全状态 S0] --&gt; B[脏标记: 只留活跃对象]&#10;    B --&gt; C[delta: 存相对上帧差值]&#10;    C --&gt; D[量化: float→定点/低位宽]&#10;    D --&gt; E[位打包: 按最小位数紧排]&#10;    E --&gt; F[多分辨率: 远处降精度]&#10;    F --&gt; G[压缩后 S ≈ S0/10 或更低]&#10;    C --&gt; K[周期插入关键帧&lt;br/&gt;作为delta解码起点]\">flowchart TD\n    A[原始每帧全状态 S0] --&gt; B[脏标记: 只留活跃对象]\n    B --&gt; C[delta: 存相对上帧差值]\n    C --&gt; D[量化: float→定点/低位宽]\n    D --&gt; E[位打包: 按最小位数紧排]\n    E --&gt; F[多分辨率: 远处降精度]\n    F --&gt; G[压缩后 S ≈ S0/10 或更低]\n    C --&gt; K[周期插入关键帧&lt;br/&gt;作为delta解码起点]</pre><h2 id=\"各手段的取舍一览\">各手段的取舍一览</h2><p>四种手段可叠加，但各有代价，按项目约束选组合。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>手段</th>\n<th>典型收益</th>\n<th>主要代价</th>\n<th>何时优先</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>增量/差分</td>\n<td>数量级</td>\n<td>随机访问需关键帧回溯</td>\n<td>几乎总是首选</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>量化</td>\n<td>2–4x</td>\n<td>有损，需控误差</td>\n<td>精度冗余明显时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>位打包</td>\n<td>1.5–3x</td>\n<td>CPU 编解码开销</td>\n<td>内存比 CPU 紧时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多分辨率</td>\n<td>视时长而定</td>\n<td>回放跨层衔接复杂</td>\n<td>超长倒流</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>顺序也有讲究：先脏标记去掉静止对象，再 delta 去掉时间冗余，再量化去掉精度冗余，最后位打包榨干位宽。反过来做（比如先位打包再 delta）会互相抵消收益。</p>\n<h2 id=\"cpu-与内存的再平衡\">CPU 与内存的再平衡</h2><p>压缩不是免费的——它把内存问题部分转成了 CPU 问题。每帧记录时要编码、倒放时要解码，压得越狠、编解码越费时。倒流系统因此是典型的时空权衡场。</p>\n<p>务实的平衡点有两条经验。其一，<strong>记录侧的编码要极快</strong>，因为它每帧都在正常游玩时跑，不能吃掉帧预算——所以记录侧偏爱 delta + 量化这类算术简单的手段，避免重量级熵编码。其二，<strong>回放侧可以稍慢</strong>，因为倒流时通常允许一点点计算余量（世界的正常逻辑已暂停）。是否值得为多省几 MB 再加一层压缩，要放到整帧预算里权衡——这正是 <a href=\"../../game-performance-optimization/gpu-memory/memory-management\">游戏性能优化 · 内存管理</a> 讲的时空取舍。此外，环形缓冲最好一次性预分配、复用内存块，避免每帧 delta 大小波动引发的堆分配抖动。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>内存账单 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>T</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M = f\\cdot T\\cdot S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span>；时长 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 由玩法锁死、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span> 已压过，主战场是单帧字节 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li>四刀依次叠加：脏标记去静止对象 → delta 去时间冗余 → 量化去精度冗余 → 位打包榨位宽；超长倒流再加多分辨率。</li>\n<li>delta 收益最大但需周期性关键帧支持随机访问，与视频 I/P 帧同构。</li>\n<li>压缩把内存问题转成 CPU 问题：记录侧编码要极快（delta+量化）、回放侧可稍慢；环形缓冲预分配复用避免堆抖动。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>内存账单与多速率环出处：<a href=\"../recording/ring-buffer\">环形缓冲</a></li>\n<li>脏标记与单帧结构：<a href=\"../recording/state-snapshots\">状态快照</a></li>\n<li>跨库：时空取舍与内存管理，见 <a href=\"../../game-performance-optimization/gpu-memory/memory-management\">游戏性能优化 · 内存管理</a>；重放数据压缩另见 <a href=\"../../game-replay-determinism/practice/replay-compression-storage\">游戏回放与确定性 · 回放压缩存储</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"内存与压缩：把 40MB 装进整关倒流","id":"内存与压缩-把-40mb-装进整关倒流"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"内存预算：先算清账单","id":"内存预算-先算清账单"},{"level":2,"text":"四种压缩手段","id":"四种压缩手段"},{"level":2,"text":"各手段的取舍一览","id":"各手段的取舍一览"},{"level":2,"text":"CPU 与内存的再平衡","id":"cpu-与内存的再平衡"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"分支时间线：从过去重新出发","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-time-rewind-mechanics/playback/branching-timelines"},"next":{"title":"确定性与浮点：状态还原 vs 重算重放的交界","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-time-rewind-mechanics/practice/rewind-determinism"}}